  "protocol": "Token distribution clones of 0xb4ba49c9",
  "name": "Distribution clones' initializer 0xe7d25975 can be called again by anyone",
  "summary": "Hub 0x8dc0d817 created 187 EIP-1167 clones of the unverified implementation 0xb4ba49c9 in January-April 2021, each holding one project's tokens for distribution (sibling hub 0xe976ccd4 created 40 clones of the earlier version 0x6d968702). The initializer 0xe7d25975, run by the hub at creation, has no guard against a second call, so anyone can re-run it naming themselves as admin and token; as admin the caller then runs 0x4abe11b4 and 0xd547557b and withdraws the clone's whole balance of a chosen token with 0x90fb9dca(token, 0). In the anchor attacker 0x4e087743's contract 0x3763b7f8 did this to 24 clones, sold most of the tokens for WETH on Uniswap V2 and took 3.49 ETH from one; it and six other senders drained 109 clones of both versions in 48 transactions over the next six days.",
