  "notes": [
    "Targets are the 24 clones the anchor executed, each running 0xb4ba49c9 by delegatecall; each ages from its creation by the hub (rule 9), and the latest, 0xe2637e70 (0x7bbf9db7, block 12212263), sets the age. Both implementations and hubs are unverified; the mechanism is read from the anchor's trace: per clone the four calls emit 0xd9fd1a29, 0xbc947384 and the withdrawal event 0xeb1744c1 and move the clone's token balance to the caller. Later writes resets.mjs lists on these clones are claims (slot 7, live balances) and the projects' admins closing their distributions (0x6c31364c: status in slot 3 from 2 to 4, flag bit 16 in slot 0x12); the exploit's re-initialisation overwrites slots 2-7 and 0xb, and clones still at status 2 with the flag clear were drained the same way, so none of these writes was needed and none resets the age (rule 8).",
    "Earlier exploits: every log of all 187 clones of 0xb4ba49c9 (blocks 11625142-26310917) and all 40 clones of 0x6d968702 (from block 11200000) was scanned. Before the anchor, the 0xeb1744c1 withdrawals (56 transactions, 51 on 0xb4ba49c9 clones and 5 on 0x6d968702 clones, 2020-12 to 2022-01) are plain 0x90fb9dca calls sent straight to the clone by the deployers 0x3904efc3, 0x0cbc4e5e, 0xe3fcd01a or a project's own admin EOA, without the 0xd9fd1a29/0xbc947384 sequence that the re-initialisation path emits; that sequence first appears in the anchor. trace_filter over all 187 clones of 0xb4ba49c9 from block 11625142 to 18560000 finds 0xe7d25975 called only by hub 0x8dc0d817 inside each clone's creation transaction, until the anchor's 24 calls from attack contract 0x3763b7f8; the 40 sibling clones were checked by their logs only.",
    "Campaign: the 47 further transactions with that sequence, by 0x4e087743 (3), 0xfbc36935 (17), 0x0000000000000f25a0 (8), 0x2d32f31a (8), 0xa54408e0 (5), 0x97233333 (5) and 0x0000000000008e35 (1), between blocks 18552873 and 18596682; 18 of them hit clones of the sibling version 0x6d968702 (same author 0x1a17e083, hub 0xe976ccd4), which share the re-callable initializer. No clone of either version emits the sequence after block 18596682.",
    "Loss is the 109 drained clones' outflow priced by loss.mjs at DefiLlama ($182,598.69 for 36 priced tokens and 4.22 ETH), plus the WETH the attackers realised selling unpriced tokens in the same transactions (rule 12): MoFi 1.578, STAK 0.182, MRCH 0.135, CATE 0.132, VTX 0.078, INFI 0.020, DWZ 0.016, SOTA 0.007, BLANK 0.006, TXA 0.0007 WETH, 2.154 WETH at $2,042.91. Eleven unpriced tokens that were not sold in those transactions (SPHRI, LABS, ALK, X22, KYL, ENX, SPWN, SOME, L3P, ROYA, CVR) are valued at 0. For the priced tokens the in-transaction sale proceeds are close to the DefiLlama values (e.g. RAIL about $27.3k realised against $31.8k), so market prices are kept."
